# Shared contracts

- Zod schemas are the source of truth. Infer types with `z.infer` / `z.input` / `z.output`.
- No Nest, Next, React, Prisma, domain entities, or repositories in this package.
- Transport contracts stay separate from domain models.
- Export through `src/index.ts` and add valid/invalid schema tests.
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/create-shared-contract/SKILL.md`.
